    "value": {
      "type": "cv-value-stack",
      "blocks": {
        "fix-0": {
          "type": "fix",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "honeycomb",
            "metric_value": "12",
            "metric_unit": "ft",
            "problem": "It cracks on the first real drop",
            "body": "<p>Slim usually means solid plastic corners that pass the shock straight into the frame. These corners are a honeycomb of collapsing air cells — they crush, absorb, and spring back. 26 drops onto concrete from 12 feet, no phone damage.</p>",
            "them_title": "Typical slim case",
            "them_label": "6–8 ft",
            "us_title": "Casify",
            "us_label": "12 ft"
          }
        },
        "fix-1": {
          "type": "fix",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "magnet-ring",
            "metric_value": "1400",
            "metric_unit": "g",
            "problem": "The magnet lets go when you need it",
            "body": "<p>\"MagSafe compatible\" is a sticker, not a spec. We publish pull force. Eighteen N52 magnets in a full ring hold 1,400 g, so your phone stays on the vent mount over a speed bump — and still charges at the full Qi2 25W.</p>",
            "them_title": "Category average",
            "them_label": "800–900 g",
            "us_title": "Casify",
            "us_label": "1,400 g"
          }
        },
        "fix-2": {
          "type": "fix",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "no-yellow",
            "metric_value": "36",
            "metric_unit": "mo",
            "problem": "Clear turns yellow by month four",
            "body": "<p>Cheap TPU oxidises under UV and skin oil — that's why your last clear case looked like an old fingernail. This back is UV-stable polycarbonate with a bonded top coat: no measurable colour shift after the equivalent of three years outdoors.</p>",
            "them_title": "Standard TPU",
            "them_label": "Yellow by month 4",
            "us_title": "Casify",
            "us_label": "No shift at 36 mo"
          }
        },
        "ben-0": {
          "type": "benefit",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "wireless-charge",
            "title": "Qi2 25W charging",
            "body": "Full-speed wireless charging with the case on — no adapter, no guessing."
